{"id":50944,"date":"2026-05-01T10:34:34","date_gmt":"2026-05-01T09:34:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50944"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:28:24","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:28:24","slug":"leiria-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/leiria-run\/","title":{"rendered":"Leiria Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Leiria Run 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Leiria Run 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica e vibrante cidade do Lis, <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Leiria<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Teatro Jos\u00e9 L\u00facio da Silva<\/strong>, em parceria com os principais clubes desportivos locais (ADAL, CA Barreira, COC, Juventude Vidigalense, LizRunners e NEL), a prova \u00e9 a maior festa de urban trail e corrida noturna da regi\u00e3o Centro.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a Rodrigues Lobo<\/strong> e meta grandiosa no interior do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Municipal Dr. Magalh\u00e3es Pessoa<\/strong>, o percurso desafia os atletas a transpor as escadarias medievais, muralhas do <strong>Castelo de Leiria<\/strong>, travessas hist\u00f3ricas e margens do Rio Lis. O evento conta com a <strong>Corrida Urban Trail de 14 km<\/strong> (20h00) e a <strong>Caminhada de 9 km<\/strong> (19h00), garantindo cronometragem chip Lap2Go, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal, banhos e uma megafesta final com DJ no relvado do est\u00e1dio.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 19:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: co